      "Paul's confrontation with Peter at Antioch over table fellowship with Gentiles (Galatians 2:11-14) is a rare, undisguised account of conflict between two major apostolic leaders, and scholars continue to debate exactly how the dispute was resolved and how it relates to the account of the Jerusalem Council in Acts 15.",
