      "Born about six months before Jesus (Luke 1:26, 36) to Zechariah and Elizabeth in their old age. Executed by Herod Antipas (Matthew 14:1-12) shortly before Jesus' own crucifixion; the exact year isn't given but fits comfortably within Antipas's reign and the Gospel timeline.",
