      "Elijah also confronted Ahab's son King Ahaziah after the king sought healing from a foreign god rather than Israel's, and famously called down fire from heaven to consume two companies of soldiers sent to arrest him before finally going with a third captain who approached humbly (2 Kings 1:1-16).",
