      "Events unfold under the Persian king Ahasuerus, almost universally identified today — including by evangelical scholars — with Xerxes I (486-465 BC); Esther becomes queen in his 7th year (479 BC) and the Purim deliverance follows in his 12th year (473 BC, Esther 2:16; 3:7). Her birth and death years aren't recorded.",
